codex
I found the exact cause: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<getpid>/exe`; Lean 4.22 hard-codes the latter, so its application-path lookup fails. I’ll use a narrowly scoped compatibility preload that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` reads to `/proc/self/exe`, record its source and hash, and rerun the unchanged trusted preflight.
apply patch
